# Copy to .env (same directory) and fill in the token. .env is gitignored.
#
# The shared InfluxDB write token — the "WRITE telegraf bucket" authorization in
# the `home` org on 192.168.0.93:8086. All five nodes use this one token.
# deploy-telegraf.sh reads it and writes the per-node .env on each host,
# adding MONITOR_NODE_NAME for that node.
INFLUXDB_TOKEN=""
